 "insight": [
  "The share of Luxembourg's imports from China decreased from 12.4% in 2005 to 3.0% in 2025.",
  "The largest share was 18.6% in 2008, and the median share over 2005 to 2025 was 6.4%.",
  "The biggest drop between consecutive years was from 18.3% in 2009 to 8.7% in 2010.",
  "By 2024, the share had fallen to 0.6%, showing a continuing decline before a slight rise to 3.0% in 2025.",
  "These values are nominal and not adjusted for price changes, which may affect comparisons over time."
 ],
